<launch>

  <!--
    Compatibility shim. The module is the `vlm` package; this file only
    forwards to it.

    It exists because the challenge's own `docker/README.md` documents
    starting the module with

        ros2 launch dummy_vlm dummy_vlm.launch

    that file lives outside `ai_module/`, which the challenge README names as
    the only folder a submission should change, and the startup script the
    graders actually run is not in this repository at all. Renaming the
    package without leaving this behind would risk the module never being
    launched.

    `ros2 launch vlm vlm.launch` is the same thing and is what our own
    documentation uses.
  -->

  <include file="$(find-pkg-share vlm)/launch/vlm.launch" />

</launch>
